# ===== VS Code (machine-specific paths) =====
# settings.json  : contains absolute OpenOCD path
# c_cpp_properties.json : contains absolute compiler path
# Patterns use **/ so this also covers nested project dirs (e.g. STM_TTLSERVO/.vscode/)
**/.vscode/settings.json
**/.vscode/c_cpp_properties.json
STM_core/.vscode/

